WEBVTT

00:01:29.916 --> 00:01:33.396
Unsure of what to make of it, he thought,

00:01:33.436 --> 00:01:35.876
"Could this be a bit of old pipe, maybe?

00:01:36.716 --> 00:01:38.116
Or perhaps,

00:01:39.556 --> 00:01:41.716
is this a dinosaur skeleton?” he joked.

00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:45.716
Luckily,

00:01:45.716 --> 00:01:48.036
Joe thought to himself, "Well,

00:01:48.036 --> 00:01:50.876
could it be an important discovery?"

00:01:50.876 --> 00:01:54.076
So crucially, he sought expert advice.

00:01:55.876 --> 00:01:59.436
When these photos pinged into my inbox,

00:01:59.436 --> 00:02:04.876
I immediately recognized them
as large vertebrae